WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
Faseeh: correct your recitation in a minute.

1
00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.650
Choose the surah you want to recite.

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.800
You can select ayahs: tap the first ayah, then the last.

3
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.800
If you select nothing, you recite the whole surah.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.800
Tap “Hear the reciter” to hear the ayahs by Sheikh Muhammad Siddiq al-Minshawi.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.600
The word being recited is highlighted as you listen.

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.500
Tap “Start recording”, recite clearly, then stop the recording.

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.100
Faseeh analyses your recitation in a few seconds.

8
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:33.500
You see the share of correct words, and the word with a mistake is highlighted.

9
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:41.600
Tap the word to see its correct pronunciation written out, and where the letter is articulated.

10
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:48.400
Listen to it by the reciter: the word alone, or the whole ayah.

11
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.400
“Play my recording” plays your recitation back, so you can compare.

12
00:00:52.400 --> 00:01:00.100
In “Word pronunciation” you learn how to say any word, without recording.

13
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:05.000
Faseeh is available in thirteen languages.

14
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.500
Faseeh is an AI model that can make mistakes. It is not a substitute for a qualified teacher.
